---
source: tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Activate LanceDB-backed Sources (imports all legacy registrations)

Usage: mf source advanced enable [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --model <MODEL>
          Model ID for embeddings (default: intfloat/multilingual-e5-small)
      --root <PATH>
          Mind Repo root directory
      --config <PATH>
          Config file path
      --model-revision <MODEL_REVISION>
          Model revision (default: main)
      --model-path <MODEL_PATH>
          Path to a pre-installed model bundle
  -v, --verbose...
          Verbose output
      --dry-run
          Preview changes without writing
  -q, --quiet
          Silence non-error output
  -o, --output <FORMAT>
          Output format [default: text] [possible values: text, json]
      --json
          Shorthand for --output json
      --no-color
          Disable colored output
  -p, --project <NAME>
          Project name for project-scoped operations
  -h, --help
          Print help
  -V, --version
          Print version
